<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Keira dynasty</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Keira</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Keira dynasty was the ruling dynasty of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/darfur-sultanate">Darfur Sultanate</a>, founded in the seventeenth century by Sulayman <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/suleiman-solong">Solong</a>. It ruled until the defeat of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sultan">Sultan</a> Ibrahim in 1874. It was restored under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ali-dinar">Ali Dinar</a> after 1898 until Darfur's incorporation into <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anglo-egyptian-condominium">Anglo-Egyptian Sudan</a> in 1916.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/keira-dynasty.jpg" alt="Keira dynasty" width="320" height="372" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Koopinator · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Map_of_Darfur_in_July_1914.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
